d escape terrifying creatures that hunt you in the dark. With immersive sound design, unpredictable jumpscares, and eerie visuals, every match brings new tension and fear. Whether you're exploring alone or trying to survive with friends, the storm is always coming... and something is always watching.", "short_description": "Gorilla Raining Horror is a multiplayer VR horror game with Gorilla Tag-style movement. Explore dark, 3 short different maps to choose from, avoid terrifying creatures, and survive the storm with friends."}]}, "developer_name": "RoastyProductionz", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gorilla-raining-horror/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Roasty", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gorilla-raining-horror/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "30485294704403056"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392147_2067748017365377_4054686588648881760_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=amRLO8SCZh0Q7kNvwFEvBtH&_nc_oc=AdnMtjUiJid7w9lg3suRznuf3PNI0Svx1VTuw59gzhAVoz_PQbC6sc-3uT3arieDfNg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfueuIjgEHlEjZqvf8KDNZr78ojNG_R8fdRXrt9LDP7Xdg&oe=6